# Cautious defaults

- Plan before large changes; confirm approach when touching auth, saves, or Docker/infra.
- One concern per PR-sized change set — avoid bundling unrelated work.
- Do not add npm/pnpm packages without stating why and checking for lighter alternatives.
- Do not change docker-compose, Cloudflare assumptions, or Supabase Auth flow without calling it out.
- Run linters on edited files; do not drive-by fix unrelated lint issues.
- Prefer API routes for save/load; games must not get DB credentials or service role keys.
